cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite it as below."
title: "awe: Agentic Workflow Extractor"
abstract: >-
  A command line tool that mines the git history of CI workflow files and
  detects coding-agent invocations inside them, including GitHub Agentic
  Workflows, for large-scale studies of agentic continuous integration on
  GitHub.
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
type: software
keywords:
  - mining software repositories
  - continuous integration
  - GitHub Actions
  - coding agents
  - dataset
